{
"file": 3,
"paths": [
"d002/f585"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "aea028df",
"en_raw": "...Hanako-san's grave?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "69dc453a",
"en_raw": "You know, that rumor"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "6930e4b2",
"en_raw": "from before?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "4bfc358b",
"en_raw": "The bob-haired girl monster, or whatever"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "ddd8ce14",
"en_raw": "Yeah, I know it"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "3c64a1f0",
"en_raw": "That girl"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "cce8733e",
"en_raw": "lived in this town..."
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "fd2def55",
"en_raw": "Oh, don't get the wrong idea"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "82aac238",
"en_raw": "This story comes from the"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "0d210113",
"en_raw": "hopeless people called"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "b97b0cb3",
"en_raw": "the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "3ad9c0b5",
"en_raw": "...The Toilet Gang?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "280e5327",
"en_raw": "People led by Mika Sakai"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "1c61999f",
"en_raw": "who specialize in bad-mouthing and ghosts"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d8f55de9",
"en_raw": "Well, they're a kind of"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "ed33476e",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san themselves"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "a6469f3b",
"en_raw": "The cancer cells of our class"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "1b8babb9",
"en_raw": "But it's near Hirumi Bridge, right?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4341c832",
"en_raw": "Since we're here anyway"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6af34f6a",
"en_raw": "let's all go and see it"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "08ec26bf",
"en_raw": "...Shiina"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d44bdbb1",
"en_raw": "Do you know that bridge?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "e8b39cec",
"en_raw": "The sunsets there are so pretty"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "2d431ccc",
"en_raw": "Hmm, then Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4ce651ec",
"en_raw": "might go and see it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "31440a13",
"en_raw": "...Kind of an impure motive"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "ff43b247",
"en_raw": "What about going to see the grave?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "90f70b0d",
"en_raw": "A crossroads or something"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "ed0b0fe4",
"en_raw": "is what the Toilet Gang said, right?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "469ea35c",
"en_raw": "If we go and look"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "ad960ffa",
"en_raw": "we'd probably find out"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "5b5071ed",
"en_raw": "The Tama River? That's far..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "e4587a41",
"en_raw": "She was a strange old lady"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ae59205c",
"en_raw": "Suddenly started talking to us"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "5f3a291e",
"en_raw": "It was the same character as Kurumi's"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "4b04e995",
"en_raw": "...Hirumi, the long way, huh"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "de01b158",
"en_raw": "I prefer the short Hirumi, myself"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f5e66f02",
"en_raw": "Writing addresses on postcards"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "7c4a23b5",
"en_raw": "is easier that way"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "2e9b82e7",
"en_raw": "Oh, right!"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "d3595fd5",
"en_raw": "Sango, what about the grave?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "6ce301bb",
"en_raw": "Right, right"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "4ce5ce27",
"en_raw": "That matters more than the bridge's name"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "8785ff4b",
"en_raw": "We still haven't learned"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "f7406a3f",
"en_raw": "anything, after all"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "90cf32b0",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's leave this story"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "3ce554b3",
"en_raw": "for tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "a4bcee50",
"en_raw": "...Well, okay"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "bed5b85f",
"en_raw": "Who's hungry?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "23530248",
"en_raw": "...Me!"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "90cf32b0",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's leave this story"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3ce554b3",
"en_raw": "for tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "28c2e28f",
"en_raw": "Shiina, was the bridge interesting?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "5f3a291e",
"en_raw": "It was the same character as Kurumi's"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "15ffd158",
"en_raw": "Hirumi isn't the short one"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "21a32c00",
"en_raw": "the long one is the real one"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ca0ab204",
"en_raw": "Huh, so what? is how I feel"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "e4587a41",
"en_raw": "She was a strange old lady"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "32e15e7b",
"en_raw": "What about going to see the grave?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "664c51c9",
"en_raw": "Right, that matters more than the bridge"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "87a5fd25",
"en_raw": "We still haven't"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b9492042",
"en_raw": "learned anything, after all"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "5f4f33d0",
"en_raw": "Forget it, who cares about graves"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "5cec00a7",
"en_raw": "Oh, if you say that"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "3de40aaf",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san will bring you bad luck!"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "15577b1b",
"en_raw": "Ha ha ha"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "e6a63ac8",
"en_raw": "Sango, you're scary!"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "2529c408",
"en_raw": "I strangely remember the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "664c6897",
"en_raw": "mentioning a crossroads or something"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "dcbe03e6",
"en_raw": "But the problem is where it is"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "33dac8b8",
"en_raw": "It's impossible to find something like that"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "77734afa",
"en_raw": "And actually, what I'm really"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "a41a7805",
"en_raw": "curious about right now is"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "c4b326d6",
"en_raw": "that old lady"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "fea860ae",
"en_raw": "That old lady might know about"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "5e83ce7e",
"en_raw": "the old days..."
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "aef1b6c0",
"en_raw": "Maybe so, but..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "45b42e1b",
"en_raw": "What would you do with that info?"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "4dfa0436",
"en_raw": "Nothing"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "c40ca7d2",
"en_raw": "I just want to confront"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "50ac0fde",
"en_raw": "the Toilet Gang with"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "0398e8f3",
"en_raw": "the truth"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "bee4d143",
"en_raw": "...Well, it's just a bit of"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "a015fbe9",
"en_raw": "killing time"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "c4b326d6",
"en_raw": "that old lady"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "5b81fd14",
"en_raw": "We hit the jackpot"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "8ccbe1a8",
"en_raw": "Turn onto the road in front of the hospital"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "a777c142",
"en_raw": "and the fork beyond it"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "9f6a1486",
"en_raw": "that's the crossroads, right?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "bc9a807f",
"en_raw": "If you go through toward the river"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "756d5506",
"en_raw": "...Hime-no-Mori?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "625633a5",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "f1346772",
"en_raw": "you get to the place the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "c6a4935a",
"en_raw": "talked about, is what you're saying"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "2972daaa",
"en_raw": "That's how it works out"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "52c0e9bb",
"en_raw": "But not a word about Hanako's grave..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "42ad9359",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "e625165f",
"en_raw": "And there, lies and reality"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "ce658056",
"en_raw": "get all mixed up"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "2ebf567c",
"en_raw": "Showing the Toilet Gang the truth..."
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "4a3ed58f",
"en_raw": "...Well, that kind of"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "5903906f",
"en_raw": "stopped mattering"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "59a23d34",
"en_raw": "Looks like it"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "bd14b051",
"en_raw": "But it sounds fun, doesn't it?"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "08823f24",
"en_raw": "Let's go! And check it out"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "862b1e20",
"en_raw": "But before it gets dark"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "81813036",
"en_raw": "Sango"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3355c970",
"en_raw": "We got lost after all"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "c5c6f945",
"en_raw": "Toward the Tama River, but"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "43e5a27a",
"en_raw": "with nothing but similar-looking roads"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "e5678f06",
"en_raw": "you can't tell which way you're going"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "56494940",
"en_raw": "That's a strange place"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "d498e511",
"en_raw": "Maybe I'll give up..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "a522f1f3",
"en_raw": "Want to?"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "8b9cfcc4",
"en_raw": "Then Kurumi will"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "605e0c3e",
"en_raw": "go and take a look"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "e364b7f6",
"en_raw": "Right, places like that"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "aa23dbe8",
"en_raw": "are Shiina's specialty"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "160f561c",
"en_raw": "True, strangely she never gets lost"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "4152a13d",
"en_raw": "Must be animal instinct"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "8a6f3e12",
"en_raw": "Kasuka-chan"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "6a96493a",
"en_raw": "said"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "8be4332b",
"en_raw": "If you keep going like this"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "722c8c7e",
"en_raw": "you'll die!"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "9561b837",
"en_raw": "And then Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "247c5a8e",
"en_raw": "found it funny and laughed"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "cff7c05c",
"en_raw": "Shiina, that kid"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "bf58c85e",
"en_raw": "really said you'd die?"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "f51b4e4d",
"en_raw": "There are more kids lately"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "8663e3ea",
"en_raw": "who say nasty things"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "44ab714c",
"en_raw": "It's the parents' fault"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "4041b812",
"en_raw": "But it was a strange incident"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "74d635d5",
"en_raw": "That old lady was also"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "a9326cbd",
"en_raw": "really odd..."
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "e7baca99",
"en_raw": "Honestly"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "d45f3da6",
"en_raw": "Nothing but old stories"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "21c4e5d2",
"en_raw": "Such a nuisance, being told them"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "83aebb05",
"en_raw": "In the end, the grave"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "1b6d1de8",
"en_raw": "wasn't there, was it?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "c2e4cd72",
"en_raw": "Just knowing that"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "14e80775",
"en_raw": "is enough, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "efcd5b66",
"en_raw": "What was good about it"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "35a5eb62",
"en_raw": "I have no idea"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "e30da9a8",
"en_raw": "Searching for the grave any more"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "e5dd199f",
"en_raw": "is pointless, true"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "dc698afb",
"en_raw": "Yeah, but"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "9862fa33",
"en_raw": "This town still has"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "763ebeed",
"en_raw": "so many things we don't know"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "5d4e9116",
"en_raw": "about, you know"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "fa86399e",
"en_raw": "Like the meaning of Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "e20062d4",
"en_raw": "or the god Hime-no-Mori"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "52f56dac",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "6e8a8a8b",
"en_raw": "Watching the evening sun linger, huh..."
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "e8c2cf9a",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, lately"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "41214940",
"en_raw": "the days are getting longer"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "36fb110b",
"en_raw": "A walk with Melos"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "9e3b27aa",
"en_raw": "would surely feel nice"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "9eeca5eb",
"en_raw": "Sango, let's go together again"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "37913a7b",
"en_raw": "Like we used to"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "d7c12180",
"en_raw": "If there's some interesting place"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "573f5b8a",
"en_raw": "in this town, I'll go along"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "1419b18e",
"en_raw": "Whether it's like before, never mind"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "ce23164e",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Hanako-san's Grave"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "88267580",
"en_raw": "Even so"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "73a818f0",
"en_raw": "All we desperately tracked down was"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "4f4aa8a6",
"en_raw": "just a riverside parking lot..."
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "204250e8",
"en_raw": "You look grumpy, Sango"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "f5dbb890",
"en_raw": "Don't bother me, I'm thinking"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "aa239610",
"en_raw": "so hard you're knitting your brow"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "051a62c2",
"en_raw": "Hey, so is this how it is?"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "68469dd6",
"en_raw": "We"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "11796bc4",
"en_raw": "were played by the Toilet Gang's rumor"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "ad6bb52d",
"en_raw": "and on top of that, that old lady"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "27038322",
"en_raw": "tricked us too..."
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "d364821e",
"en_raw": "But she never said it was a grave"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "f5480e1a",
"en_raw": "Even Hime-no-Mori..."
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "75cce645",
"en_raw": "Will I see Kasuka-chan again?"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}